Hi Chris,

Thank you for the fast response, that makes sense. And yes, of course, immediately after I sent my email I realized I had mislabeled the nimbleFunction (but my original problem was the same). Anyway, below is the function I have now and it seems to work.

Many thanks,
Adrian

dnorm_vec <- nimbleFunction(

  run = function(x = double(1), mean = double(1),
  sd = double(0), log = logical(0, default = 0)) {

  returnType(double(0))

  logdens <- dnorm(x, mean, sd, log = TRUE)

  if(log) return(sum(logdens)) else return(exp(sum(logdens)))
})

